      "hallucination_observed": false,
      "rationale": "Provides a clean grouping axis for 'by issue type', which the query explicitly needs, and is not trivially redundant with the existing category column as a normalized bucket. The categorizations are well-grounded readings of short_description: 'Unable to access the database' -> Database, 'VPN issue' -> Network, 'Software update issue' -> Software all follow soundly from the text."
    }
