  "rationale": "Both columns are squarely relevant to 'resolution time by agent and issue type': one supplies the metric, the other supplies a grouping dimension. issue_type_category is well grounded in the short_description text. resolution_time_hours, however, shows serious groundedness problems -- the sample rows have identical start/end timestamps yet yield nonzero times, and multiple negative durations appear, signaling values not soundly derivable from the shown source, which drags the table-level groundedness down."
}

